# Test double for the org.kde.kirigami module.
#
# Kirigami is a runtime dependency of the app, not a build one, and it is not
# installable on every CI image. This stub gives the smoke test enough of the
# API surface to instantiate the real QML tree, so a typo in a property name,
# a missing file or a broken binding still fails the build on images without
# KF6. Where Kirigami *is* installed the tests use it instead and this stub is
# never loaded.
module org.kde.kirigami
ApplicationWindow 1.0 ApplicationWindow.qml
Page 1.0 Page.qml
PageRow 1.0 PageRow.qml
GlobalDrawer 1.0 GlobalDrawer.qml
OverlaySheet 1.0 OverlaySheet.qml
Dialog 1.0 Dialog.qml
Action 1.0 Action.qml
Icon 1.0 Icon.qml
Heading 1.0 Heading.qml
Separator 1.0 Separator.qml
SearchField 1.0 SearchField.qml
PasswordField 1.0 PasswordField.qml
PlaceholderMessage 1.0 PlaceholderMessage.qml
IconGroup 1.0 IconGroup.qml
InlineMessage 1.0 InlineMessage.qml
ListSectionHeader 1.0 ListSectionHeader.qml
Avatar 1.0 Avatar.qml
FormLayout 1.0 FormLayout.qml
singleton Units 1.0 Units.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
MessageType 1.0 MessageType.qml
